  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞击败了“扑克牌士兵”！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_120.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞捡起{F4 84 04 01 01 01 B1 07}，\n　作为击败它的证明吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_120.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 62 09}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}呵……不堪一击。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_120.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3A 0A}它们似乎也会掉落\n能用来制作装备的“素材”……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_120.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}等实力提升后，\n再回来讨伐也不失为一个好办法。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_120.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D4 05}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}啊？\n不是应该优先赶路吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_120.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 22 0A}这是出于成本效益的考虑。\n卖掉素材既能增加资金，\n也能丰富可购买的装备种类。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_120.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}与其急着赶路，\n在强大的阴影面前反复试错，\n我判断这样效率更高……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_120.bf.json:4:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 25 0A}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}……喂，你在听吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_120.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6A 05}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}是、是！\n成本……试效……对吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_120.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 0A}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_120.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 FE 09}……抱歉，忘了吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_120.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞稍后去保健室{F2 01 03 01}报告{F2 01 01 01}吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
